{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edfc213b2c45a845881a59b62f0d67bcfd80065792d9df654ba0c95eb6ba4a2",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018237656b1e9321a879caff58b8088e45cb2e3b6ccf4794e4d9a02484c530d6",
      "text": "非常抱歉！\n由于我们的疏忽，给各位添麻烦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b771a205af8c2aa36ec5b64a157097f7608276b9d0e7dbeba69028fa9702772",
      "text": "啊，请抬起头来！\n我们一开始也没注意到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45297373fbaad876172ed6f43ff9ec233bfb7282c0eecdaf14ef08c944a6da2",
      "text": "嗯——……那作为补偿的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2062a85e6b086c1664f3a8d8b48a1a207d6257fb50ad30ce3ea71183ce45f2",
      "text": "虽然不是第1名，但也让我们唱一首歌吧！\n我们的体力还充裕得很呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae346920c0ddd8832d7735fadc9ff374491300156ccb193e060d2a705b90d46e",
      "text": "好提议！让他们在舞台上见识一下，\n前足球选手的耐力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec27f2bb82584fd9b80a540413c8c6ed975d058e363cdc7b46dd3098ca7e156",
      "text": "当然可以！\n我这就去安排，拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000083:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ccdf72e12a7fb5112c5a150bf5f275606717bddcc45339d03a20373fa3a13a3",
      "text": "男极竞技场·户外舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27b60f7ce463f8a040e7b2ab59e92e5535c5d090cda243b3318d124c9f297e2",
      "text": "呀吼——！我们是来自315 Production的W！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36970d6a0bdeef3ced91b6af6d93783e2661378c276fc163a9dd70f5b408a011",
      "text": "我们拿到了特别奖，获得了唱歌的机会哦。\n大家一起嗨到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8e04214e8f9a364092f60d86f9db81d4f73431112c52ce0c0dfcd3abb8b8a02",
      "text": "那么悠介，老样子来咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ce61731b25629b245d18bcbebc5ea635238bddb3f3e44032414591f1b3c496",
      "text": "哦！把最强双胞胎的演出，传递给大家吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000145:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faab128146383227545a45b1cbcbcb0b5c042dbccb9cf302eca2bf43694072bc",
      "text": "啊，喂？\n突然打电话给你不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7947c105a7789df9e1365b4e28d2696efa9009c639b97fad16143286f926e3e",
      "text": "趁悠介在洗澡的空当，\n我想跟●●●●●●●●●●监督聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac61658d8c66f160fd5dac826f2e857e518cab5ac897d1c89d8f535779628cef",
      "text": "再次向你说声，今天辛苦了！虽然发生了\n很多预料之外的事，不过真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b978e1d1d9aba5d3d712b4e5fa46470f4640383850b136504122e58fd3dde6d6",
      "text": "结果虽然不是第1名，而是特别奖。但这是我自己\n做出了问心无愧的抉择拿到的，我并不后悔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71012a1d1f4a25255781725aa3b6e681a6314ed69eda40a37789d8a1e2dfee4",
      "text": "不过，悠介那种不假思索的行动真让人伤脑筋啊～。\n要是我没折回去的话，他打算怎么办啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000163:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e8f2688cfcfe1da7ed14b0dd6d370003d72cd051348bbc24e2813349a832eab",
      "text": "或许他早就知道\n享介先生一定会回来的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d78a76ae86eaa74676059eaf8f2fabc893066a6abe3b86d7eb5c04cf0c9e9f51",
      "text": "……也许吧。\n看着重新跑起来时的悠介，我再一次体会到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06bf2504bb98aec1603dbc1b86c494d2e4cb890959b7536507f012d8ced6bf44",
      "text": "那家伙的言语和表情，真的很耀眼呢。\n有时候，甚至会让我觉得有些遥远……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e971bfaadcf01ae62b1995b4dae6b5fd8066c71b7cf55adf86c68be7351e1d41",
      "text": "……啊！\n悠介好像洗完澡出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000174:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3a8ca6500e67da3969abdd12f316597b6fa052b3469cfa163eefa1d8700116",
      "text": "他在叫我了，我先挂了哦。\n谢谢你听我说话。回头见，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000186:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f89f0a7205fb1e2556b09cf4e39a8476e1133394063e7cec00e26d8fdd878dcb",
      "text": "这么晚打扰真不好意思，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n已经睡了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000200:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80c01703604e031e2e226fd43ef3e5128e17f71ae08e9f883529c1462eea3f8d",
      "text": "还醒着呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000201:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f5eb19346856dfd426ca6cecd0544ff5ec77d54163e278ef6578c020294151",
      "text": "啊，还醒着啊？太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e7dbe7ee0aa40af9726bd73535d3cce05b8a34265b30ed34958b189adbe4f9",
      "text": "……哎呀，糟糕。声音太大的话\n会把享介吵醒的，我得注意点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7481716034eb7a30c633fc22a967d94ca31d2dc6bd7dce0d045c1e6f13ef4a7e",
      "text": "稍微有点睡不着。\n能让我聊聊关于今天运动会的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000211:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7",
      "text": "当然可以",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000214:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:597a54023548ff81458888dec8c60055976caca9e3d6628030d7afd62318a97a",
      "text": "谢谢。\n今天能和享介一起奔跑，我真的很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59cb947db7bb3dd733423ca30a0e61516c3ffb7c33f1af759492dbf132027f20",
      "text": "平时我总是让那家伙\n操各种各样的心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000218:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f53d49c53ac084583746f26dd4a617da41ade861f635e921481ca5d35bb76fa",
      "text": "要是能稍微以哥哥的身份，\n展现出帅气的一面就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000220:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184e8bd6c4229b0f2c8b628994e480cae1d8b8715144e17e0eafa9aef58c2e4c",
      "text": "哈啊……咦，好像突然犯困了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000222:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f6a1938a077813c17816eabfa15588f1f5dce27355d641a4b920275940f7005",
      "text": "跑了一整天，又唱了歌……\n能量大概用光了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87679e02972a4d0f858ad378ecf73da1aabe71a19bc7a5f1555b55c4e66103b5",
      "text": "嗯……监督，谢谢你听我说话。\n今晚我们都好好休息吧。晚安……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
